      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.04,
          "end": 4.88,
          "en": "Let's continue working on our project here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.88,
          "end": 7.66,
          "en": "And let's continue with this link.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.66,
          "end": 9.7,
          "en": "At the moment, it looks a bit boring.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.7,
          "end": 13.67,
          "en": "And I would like to have that link look like a button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.67,
          "end": 17.51,
          "en": "Now, we'll also use a button in some other places",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.51,
          "end": 21.05,
          "en": "of our project and, therefore, instead of styling it here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.05,
          "end": 23.07,
          "en": "in the event item component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.07,
          "end": 26.51,
          "en": "I'll add a new component, which we can then reuse,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.51,
          "end": 28.4,
          "en": "which I'll add in a new folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.4,
          "end": 31.43,
          "en": "which I'll name UI for user interface.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.43,
          "end": 36.43,
          "en": "And in there, I'll add button.js file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.92,
          "end": 39.26,
          "en": "To create a button component in there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.26,
          "end": 43.46,
          "en": "which sets up this button so that we have a reusable button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 43.46,
          "end": 45.53,
          "en": "For this, in this button.js file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 45.53,
          "end": 49.03,
          "en": "we create a button component like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 49.03,
          "end": 52.26,
          "en": "A functional component which we, of course, also export.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 52.26,
          "end": 56.683,
          "en": "And then, in here, I will return a link.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 57.61,
          "end": 61.87,
          "en": "And, for this, we need to import link from next/link.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 61.87,
          "end": 64.82,
          "en": "And that link should, of course, hold a text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 64.82,
          "end": 66.91,
          "en": "which is passed in from outside.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 66.91,
          "end": 69.3,
          "en": "So, between the opening and closing tags",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 69.3,
          "end": 71.43,
          "en": "of our button component, hence,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 71.43,
          "end": 73.513,
          "en": "we can use props.children here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 74.37,
          "end": 77.22,
          "en": "And, of course, it should also lead somewhere.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 77.22,
          "end": 82.03999999999999,
          "en": "And I expect to get a link prop on this button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 82.03999999999999,
          "end": 84.68,
          "en": "which holds the actual link we wanna to go to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 84.68,
          "end": 89.343,
          "en": "and set this as a value for the ref prop here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 90.28,
          "end": 92.28,
          "en": "Now, we got this button component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 92.28,
          "end": 96.81,
          "en": "attached you now find this button.module.css file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 96.81,
          "end": 99.023,
          "en": "with some styles for this button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 99.9,
          "end": 102.15,
          "en": "And, just as before, to apply them",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 102.15,
          "end": 107.15,
          "en": "we now need to import classes from ./button.module.css.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 110.02000000000001,
          "end": 113.47,
          "en": "And then, to add those classes here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 113.47,
          "end": 116.63,
          "en": "we need to actually add an element inside",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 116.63,
          "end": 121.63,
          "en": "of the link component, we need to add an anchor tag element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 122.6,
          "end": 124.92,
          "en": "And then, on this anchor tag element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 124.92,
          "end": 128.943,
          "en": "we can set the class name and set this to classes.button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 129.95,
          "end": 132.64,
          "en": "Now, if we don't add the anchor tag,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 132.64,
          "end": 135.53,
          "en": "then the link automatically renders",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 135.53,
          "end": 137.25,
          "en": "an anchor tag under the hood,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 137.25,
          "end": 139.98,
          "en": "an anchor tag, where it basically controls",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 139.98,
          "end": 142.5,
          "en": "what happens when that link is clicked though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 142.5,
          "end": 145.51,
          "en": "so that we don't send a request for a new file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 145.51,
          "end": 148.02,
          "en": "but instead it captures that request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 148.02,
          "end": 152.11,
          "en": "and loads a new page with JavaScript only.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 152.11,
          "end": 154.75,
          "en": "But if you want to apply custom styling,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 154.75,
          "end": 158.31,
          "en": "then you need to add that anchor tag on your own.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 158.31,
          "end": 161.34,
          "en": "And the link component will basically detect",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 161.34,
          "end": 164.45,
          "en": "that there now is a anchor tag inside of it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 164.45,
          "end": 167.91,
          "en": "and it will no longer render its own anchor tag",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 167.91,
          "end": 169.99,
          "en": "but instead render yours,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 169.99,
          "end": 172.88,
          "en": "but then add all that functionality",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 172.88,
          "end": 177.06,
          "en": "where it captures clicks on that link and so on for you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 177.06,
          "end": 180.11,
          "en": "So, it will add that functionality, that all works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 180.11,
          "end": 183.74,
          "en": "We just add our own anchor tag to add classes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 183.74,
          "end": 186.46,
          "en": "We don't, and that's important,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 186.46,
          "end": 191.01,
          "en": "we don't set the ref attribute on this anchor tag though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 191.01,
          "end": 194.27,
          "en": "as I just said, that will be added automatically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 194.27,
          "end": 197.65,
          "en": "by the link component, which is right wrapped around that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 197.65,
          "end": 200.09,
          "en": "So, we just set it up like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 200.09,
          "end": 202.25,
          "en": "And, now, we can use this button component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 202.25,
          "end": 204.21,
          "en": "in the event item component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 204.21,
          "end": 209.21,
          "en": "Here, instead of this link, we can now use our own button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 210.16,
          "end": 214.93,
          "en": "And, of course, for that make sure you also import button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 214.93,
          "end": 218.003,
          "en": "from the UI folder, and the button file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 219.63,
          "end": 224.02,
          "en": "And then, here, we can still say explore event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 224.02,
          "end": 227.48,
          "en": "And, now, we set the link prop on the button component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 227.48,
          "end": 229.76,
          "en": "because that's what I'm expecting here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 229.76,
          "end": 234.76,
          "en": "I'm expecting a link prop and I set this here equal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 234.89,
          "end": 239.11,
          "en": "to the explorer link, just as before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 239.11,
          "end": 240.93,
          "en": "And of course this button, technically,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 240.93,
          "end": 242.67,
          "en": "now isn't a button but a link,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 242.67,
          "end": 245.933,
          "en": "but it will look like a button, hence the component name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 247.07,
          "end": 248.67,
          "en": "If you now save all files,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 248.67,
          "end": 250.833,
          "en": "you should have this button look here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 251.81,
          "end": 255.15,
          "en": "Now, adding a button was one important thing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 255.15,
